  "title": "Meta Launches Personal AI Agent Muse to Compete with AI Platforms",
  "summary": "Meta introduces its AI agent Muse, a personal assistant capable of managing tasks like email, payments, and bookings, as part of its broader AI strategy to compete with existing platforms. The product is designed to enhance user experience and challenge the status quo in AI development.",
  "facts": [
